## Ecommerce Application

The mobile application must reproduce the required functionality
of the existing ecommerce web application.

The existing web application is the functional reference.

Major domains include:

- Shopping
- Categories
- Products
- Cart
- Checkout
- Payments
- Customer
- Seller
- Affiliate
- Admin

The mobile application should preserve the business behavior of
the existing system while adapting the user experience to mobile.

Do not blindly reproduce web layouts.

Use mobile-appropriate navigation, layouts and interactions.

## Roles

The application supports:

- Customer
- Seller
- Affiliate
- Admin

Role-based access must be enforced by the backend.

The mobile application may use the authenticated user's role to
determine navigation and UI, but the client must never be treated
as the source of authorization.

