## Functional Parity

Before considering a feature complete, compare the mobile
implementation against the corresponding web functionality.

Verify:

- API behavior
- Business rules
- Permissions
- Validation
- User actions
- Success states
- Loading states
- Empty states
- Error states
- Edge cases

Mobile UI does not need to visually match the web UI.

Mobile functionality and business behavior should match unless
a mobile-specific UX decision has been explicitly approved.